  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Some Instructions:

    -The enemy stays in the center while the player
    can move to the squares other than the middle one with movement cards.

    -The
    cards on the bottom are the usable cards. The cards to the bottom right are the
    cards left in the deck. The player draws cards from the deck at the end of a
    turn or through card drawing effects. Action points also get refreshed at the
    end of each turn.

    -Divine Focus is similar to action points but are used
    for "Shifting" which will be implemented.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 53d14f70e9d5840caa091b3aaea132bb, type: 2}
